{"unit_id":"wyin77__dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer#card-zh","repo":"wyin77/dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer","commit":"9415bff9e972b4655ced7a83b3ed47bd857525ed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Prompt Optimizer 是面向 Web 对话输入框的提示词优化插件。它在模型选择器旁提供按钮，使用当前会话模型改写草稿并写回输入框；首次成功后可基于原稿再次调整。插件会校验草稿和请求状态，并提供中英文反馈，适合希望发送前完善编程需求的用户。模型调用由 DSH 宿主服务处理。无需单独配置插件密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:325-342","lib/client.js:176-240","lib/index.js:157-249"]}
{"unit_id":"wyin77__dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer#card-en","repo":"wyin77/dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer","commit":"9415bff9e972b4655ced7a83b3ed47bd857525ed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Prompt Optimizer adds rewriting to the web composer. A button sends the draft through the host service to the session model and replaces it with the result. Users can refine a successful result again using the original draft. It checks input state and provides Chinese and English feedback.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:325-342","lib/client.js:176-240","lib/index.js:157-249"]}
